# Only these go to Vercel: the public StoryBridge page and the SmileCard website. Recordings (data/), the speech
# models, keys (.env), and the StoryBridge server stay off it. `vercel dev` follows this list too: without it, it
# would hand out files from data/ to anyone on the Wi-Fi.
/*
!/vercel.json
!/frontend
!/smilecard-site
.env*
node_modules
frontend/dist
smilecard-site/.vite
